---

## Notes on Data Quality

* Some timestamps were missing in source pollution files and were removed.
* Location features are synthetic approximations.
* All datasets share consistent station names and date formats.
* No modeling or prediction was performed in this stage.

---

## Project Status

Week 1 data engineering pipeline completed successfully.
Dataset is ready for exploratory analysis and modeling in the next phase.
